  "measurementTechnique": "Logical consistency: Normal calibration of CTD instruments at IOS, calibration of nutrient analyzer with commercial standards, standard seawater (salinity), calibration of fluorometer with commercial standards,\n\nCompleteness: Dataset Complications: The accuracy of the CTD data may vary depending on the instruments used and whether collaborating data were collected for intercomparison purposes. Guildline CTDs are standardized at IOS; Sea-Bird CTD`s are calibrated at Sea-Bird Electronics in Bellevue, Washington. Electronic Data Complications: Null\n\nProcessing step (1995): Collaborative data with IOS, UBC and PBS",
